{"seq":2,"slug":"auction-session-schedule","title":"拍卖专场与排期运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-fraud-ops/auction-session-schedule","wordCount":2499,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"拍卖专场与排期运营\">拍卖专场与排期运营</h1><p>单场拍卖的规则再严密，也挡不住一个纯运营层面的灾难：八千场拍卖被排在同一个整点结束。那一分钟里，结算调度器要判定八千次落槌、推送八千条通知、发起八千条结算 Saga，而出价流量正好也挤在最后三十秒。专场（session）与排期（schedule）就是给这场必然到来的高峰做容量规划与流量整形——它同时是运营工具和系统防护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>**专场（session）**是把一批拍卖打包成一个运营单元：同一主题、同一开拍时间、同一结束时间窗。它承担三个职责：主题化的商品聚集（提高相关标的的交叉曝光）、统一的时间锚点（让用户知道什么时候来）、以及可控的结束节奏（把落槌时间铺开而不是堆在一点）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>排期维度</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>专场分组</td>\n<td>主题聚合、交叉曝光</td>\n<td>商品分散、曝光不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开拍时间</td>\n<td>蓄水期长短</td>\n<td>蓄水不足导致零出价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结束时点</td>\n<td>峰值裁剪</td>\n<td>落槌风暴、结算积压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单场时长</td>\n<td>竞价轮次数量</td>\n<td>过短导致出价不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结束间隔</td>\n<td>平滑峰值</td>\n<td>集中落槌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[选品池] --&gt; B[专场编排]&#10;  B --&gt; C[主题/分类分组]&#10;  C --&gt; D[开拍时间 T_open]&#10;  D --&gt; E[结束时间 T_close]&#10;  E --&gt; F{结束峰值检查}&#10;  F --&gt;|超容量| G[拉伸结束间隔&lt;br/&gt;错峰]&#10;  F --&gt;|可接受| H[发布排期]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[到期自动开拍]&#10;  I --&gt; J[落槌调度&lt;br/&gt;按秒分片]&#10;  J --&gt; K[结算队列]\">graph TD\n  A[选品池] --&gt; B[专场编排]\n  B --&gt; C[主题/分类分组]\n  C --&gt; D[开拍时间 T_open]\n  D --&gt; E[结束时间 T_close]\n  E --&gt; F{结束峰值检查}\n  F --&gt;|超容量| G[拉伸结束间隔&lt;br/&gt;错峰]\n  F --&gt;|可接受| H[发布排期]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[到期自动开拍]\n  I --&gt; J[落槌调度&lt;br/&gt;按秒分片]\n  J --&gt; K[结算队列]</pre><h2 id=\"结束时间的峰值裁剪\">结束时间的峰值裁剪</h2><h3 id=\"落槌风暴的量化\">落槌风暴的量化</h3><p>设专场有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 场拍卖、计划结束时点跨度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，则落槌速率峰值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>close</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>W</mi></mfrac><mtext> 场/秒</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{close}} \\approx \\frac{n}{W}\\ \\text{场/秒}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">close</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">场</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=8000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8000</span></span></span></span></span> 场全部排在同一个整点结束，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，峰值瞬间超过任何单点容量。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 拉长到 900 秒，峰值降到约 8.9 场/秒，落槌与结算流量就被摊平到可调度范围。</p>\n<p>真正的工程做法是<strong>给每场拍卖分配一个确定的结束秒</strong>，而不是让它们共享一个结束时刻：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE auction_session (&#10;  session_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  title        TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  opens_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  closes_from  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  closes_to    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  max_slots    INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  slot_count   INT         NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  status       TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT slot_capacity CHECK (slot_count &lt;= max_slots),&#10;  CONSTRAINT window_valid  CHECK (closes_to &gt; closes_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE session_slot (&#10;  session_id  BIGINT      NOT NULL REFERENCES auction_session(session_id),&#10;  slot_sec    INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  close_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (session_id, slot_sec)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> auction_session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  session_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  title        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opens_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closes_from  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closes_to    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_slots    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slot_count   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slot_capacity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (slot_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_slots),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window_valid  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (closes_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> closes_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> session_slot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  session_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction_session(session_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  slot_sec    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  close_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (session_id, slot_sec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_slots</code> + <code>slot_count</code> 在数据库层强制容量上限，避免运营在排期工具里超卖时段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分片调度\">分片调度</h3><p>落槌调度器不应「每秒查一次所有到期的拍卖」，而应按结束时间分片、提前预热：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;closer&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;tick_ms&quot;: 1000,&#10;    &quot;lookahead_sec&quot;: 30,&#10;    &quot;shard_by&quot;: &quot;close_at_epoch_sec&quot;,&#10;    &quot;claim&quot;: { &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;lease&quot;, &quot;lease_sec&quot;: 120, &quot;max_attempts&quot;: 5 },&#10;    &quot;batch_size&quot;: 200,&#10;    &quot;on_lease_expired&quot;: &quot;reclaim_and_reclose_idempotent&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"closer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tick_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lookahead_sec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"shard_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"close_at_epoch_sec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"claim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lease\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lease_sec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_attempts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"batch_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_lease_expired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reclaim_and_reclose_idempotent\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lease</code> 模式保证同一场拍卖在同一时刻只有一个调度实例在处理，租约过期后可以重新认领——而重新认领是安全的，因为落槌判定本身是幂等可重算的，见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/winning-close-settlement\">中标判定与成交结算</a>。这条「可重认领」的要求直接决定了判定的写法：若判定带副作用（例如直接扣库存），租约过期后的重认领就会重复扣减，因此<strong>判定必须是无副作用的纯计算，副作用一律交给结算阶段</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>过小</th>\n<th>过大</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>tick_ms</td>\n<td>时钟抖动下漏判</td>\n<td>落槌延迟可感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lookahead_sec</td>\n<td>无预热、突发</td>\n<td>预热浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lease_sec</td>\n<td>长任务被重复认领</td>\n<td>故障恢复慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>batch_size</td>\n<td>吞吐不足</td>\n<td>单批延迟抬高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"高峰容量的事实来源\">高峰容量的事实来源</h3><p>排期系统不能只把「结束时间」当成一个展示字段，它必须是容量计算的输入。做法是把每场拍卖的 <code>close_at</code> 落到一个按秒分桶的计数表上，排期变更时同步更新，调度器与容量告警都读这张表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW close_rate_per_sec AS&#10;SELECT date_trunc(&#39;second&#39;, close_at) AS sec,&#10;       count(*)::int                  AS closes&#10;  FROM auction&#10; WHERE status IN (&#39;scheduled&#39;, &#39;preview&#39;, &#39;running&#39;)&#10; GROUP BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MATERIALIZED VIEW close_rate_per_sec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'second'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, close_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sec,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> closes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scheduled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'preview'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'running'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有了这张视图，「加一批标的到这个专场会不会制造落槌风暴」就变成一个可以提前回答的查询，而不是上线后才知道的意外。<code>close_rate_per_sec</code> 的峰值就是 <code>closer</code> 组件每秒需要处理的上限，应直接作为其 <code>batch_size × (1000/tick_ms)</code> 的容量目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开拍时间与蓄水\">开拍时间与蓄水</h2><h3 id=\"蓄水期的意义\">蓄水期的意义</h3><p>拍卖不是上架即有人出价的。真正的出价需要「发现—关注—等待—出价」这个过程，因此专场需要一个蓄水期：从商品可见到正式开拍之间的窗口。蓄水期太短，用户来不及发现；太长，关注热度衰减。</p>\n<p>对系统而言，蓄水期对应一个明确的<strong>可观测状态</strong>：拍卖已可见但尚未接受出价。这个状态必须是一等公民，而不是靠 <code>close_time</code> 推算——否则所有「能否出价」的判断都会散落在各处。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>允许的操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>排期</td>\n<td><code>scheduled</code></td>\n<td>编辑参数、换 slot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓄水/预览</td>\n<td><code>preview</code></td>\n<td>围观、收藏、预约提醒；不可出价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞拍</td>\n<td><code>running</code></td>\n<td>出价、代理、买断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结束</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n<td>只读</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"时区与本地化\">时区与本地化</h3><p>海外专场的开拍时间必须按<strong>目标市场本地时间</strong>设计，而不是平台总部时间。这带来一个数据约束：<code>opens_at</code> 与 <code>closes_from/to</code> 必须存为带时区的时间戳（<code>TIMESTAMPTZ</code>），并额外记录专场所面向的市场时区标识，供展示层换算。</p>\n<p>这不是风格问题而是正确性问题。夏令时会让本地挂钟时间与实际时刻的对应关系发生跳变：秋季回拨时同一个本地小时会出现两次（一次在夏令时、一次在标准时），春季前拨时会有一段本地时间<strong>根本不存在</strong>。要让本地时间无歧义地映射到 UTC，必须依赖该时区的转换数据或显式携带偏移量（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tz_database\">Wikipedia, tz database</a>）。把本地时间当裸时间戳存储，会在切换日产生一小时偏移，让预热任务提前或延后触发——而这一小时的偏差恰好落在「结束时间」上时，就是一场拍卖被提前关闭。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>夏令时切换日行为</th>\n<th>可用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>TIMESTAMP</code>（无时区）+ 本地字符串</td>\n<td>无法区分重复/缺失的本地时刻</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TIMESTAMPTZ</code>（UTC 时刻）</td>\n<td>唯一确定</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TIMESTAMPTZ</code> + 展示时区 ID</td>\n<td>唯一确定且可正确本地化</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"落槌时刻的抖动\">落槌时刻的抖动</h3><p>即使把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 场铺到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 秒窗口内，若分配算法是确定性的固定间隔，所有调度实例在同一秒内仍会针对同一批 <code>close_at</code> 并发查询。这与「大量进程被同一事件同时唤醒、只有一个能真正处理」的惊群问题同源；通用的缓解手段是错开唤醒时机、在重试间隔中加入随机抖动，从而让竞争者在时间上散开（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thundering_herd_problem\">Wikipedia, Thundering herd problem</a>）。</p>\n<p>拍卖排期里这一条有直接落地形式：slot 分配时不要用 <code>floor(offset / step)</code> 这类完全规则的取模，而应把标的按确定性哈希打散到时段内，使同一秒内到达的拍卖在标的归属上也是分散的——这样即使调度器集中查询，写锁也落在不同的聚合根上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"专场结构对竞价的影响\">专场结构对竞价的影响</h2><h3 id=\"主题聚焦与交叉曝光\">主题聚焦与交叉曝光</h3><p>同主题标的放在一个专场里，会互相导流：高热度标的的围观者会顺带看到同类低热度标的。这是专场最重要的运营价值，也带来一个可观测的副作用——同专场的成交率与出价密度通常高于散排标的。</p>\n<p>反过来，把毫不相关的标的硬塞进一个专场，会让导流变成噪音。专场的选品规则应当是「买家画像重合度」而不是「卖家是谁」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"竞争密度与专场容量\">竞争密度与专场容量</h3><p>一个专场内的标的在争夺同一批竞买人的注意力与预算，因此存在容量上限：专场标的数过多，单场的平均出价人数下降。实践中需要用历史数据估计「专场规模—平均出价人数」的关系曲线，并据此设定 <code>max_slots</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>专场规模</th>\n<th>平均出价人数</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过小</td>\n<td>高但总成交少</td>\n<td>合并同类专场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>维持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过大</td>\n<td>注意力稀释</td>\n<td>拆分或延长结束窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判定专场健康度所依据的指标（出价密度、成交率、价格实现度）定义见 <a href=\"auction-liquidity-price-discovery\">竞价流动性与价格发现度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排期的变更与冲突\">排期的变更与冲突</h2><h3 id=\"开拍后不可变更的部分\">开拍后不可变更的部分</h3><p>专场一旦开拍，可变更的只有不影响既有承诺的部分：追加新标的、延长结束窗口（延长不损害任何人）。不可变更的是结束时间的<strong>提前</strong>——它会剥夺已出价者的竞价机会，与拍卖的承诺结构冲突。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;schedule_mutation_rules&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;before_open&quot;: { &quot;edit&quot;: &quot;free&quot;, &quot;remove&quot;: &quot;free&quot;, &quot;reschedule&quot;: &quot;free&quot; },&#10;    &quot;preview&quot;: { &quot;edit&quot;: &quot;price_only&quot;, &quot;remove&quot;: &quot;if_no_watchers&quot;, &quot;reschedule&quot;: &quot;free&quot; },&#10;    &quot;running&quot;: { &quot;edit&quot;: &quot;none&quot;, &quot;remove&quot;: &quot;seller_cancel_only&quot;, &quot;reschedule&quot;: &quot;extend_only&quot; },&#10;    &quot;closed&quot;: { &quot;edit&quot;: &quot;none&quot;, &quot;remove&quot;: &quot;none&quot;, &quot;reschedule&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"schedule_mutation_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"before_open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"edit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"free\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"remove\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"free\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reschedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"free\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"preview\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"edit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"remove\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"if_no_watchers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reschedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"free\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"running\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"edit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"remove\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller_cancel_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reschedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"extend_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"closed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"edit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"remove\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reschedule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>running</code> 阶段允许 <code>extend_only</code> 是与反狙击延时一致的原则：结束时间只能往后。见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/anti-sniping-time-extend\">反狙击自动延时</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"slot-冲突与重排\">slot 冲突与重排</h3><p>同一标的不能同时出现在两个专场。这条约束用「listing 在其生命周期内同一时刻最多一个活跃 auction」表达，与重上架的谱系模型配合：见 <a href=\"../auction-close-settle/unsold-relist-flow\">流拍处理与重新上拍</a> 中的 <code>auction</code> 表结构与 <code>(listing_id, attempt_no)</code> 唯一约束。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突</th>\n<th>检测</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同 listing 两场</td>\n<td>活跃 auction 唯一约束</td>\n<td>拒绝排期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>slot 超容量</td>\n<td><code>slot_count &lt;= max_slots</code></td>\n<td>拒绝或换 slot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与既有专场时间重叠</td>\n<td>时间窗口相交查询</td>\n<td>提示并允许（不硬禁）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家自拍冲突（同批标的多场）</td>\n<td>卖家维度查询</td>\n<td>提示，避免自我竞争</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三条不硬禁是有意的：不同专场的重叠在运营上是常见且合理的（面向不同市场时区），只需提示排期者注意预算竞争。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>专场同时是运营单元与容量工具：主题聚合、统一时间锚点、可控落槌节奏。</li>\n<li>落槌峰值可用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx n/W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 估算，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 场铺到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 秒窗口内是最直接的削峰手段。</li>\n<li>每场拍卖应分配确定的结束秒，调度器按结束时间分片并以租约认领，重认领依赖判定的幂等性。</li>\n<li>「可预览不可出价」的蓄水态必须是一等状态，不能靠时间推算。</li>\n<li>开拍时间按时区存 <code>TIMESTAMPTZ</code> 并记录目标市场时区，避免夏令时偏移。</li>\n<li>专场规模过大会稀释单场出价人数，<code>max_slots</code> 应由历史曲线而非直觉决定。</li>\n<li>开拍后结束时间只能延长不能提前，与反狙击延时保持同一原则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拍卖专场与排期运营","id":"拍卖专场与排期运营"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"结束时间的峰值裁剪","id":"结束时间的峰值裁剪"},{"level":3,"text":"落槌风暴的量化","id":"落槌风暴的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"分片调度","id":"分片调度"},{"level":3,"text":"高峰容量的事实来源","id":"高峰容量的事实来源"},{"level":2,"text":"开拍时间与蓄水","id":"开拍时间与蓄水"},{"level":3,"text":"蓄水期的意义","id":"蓄水期的意义"},{"level":3,"text":"时区与本地化","id":"时区与本地化"},{"level":3,"text":"落槌时刻的抖动","id":"落槌时刻的抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"专场结构对竞价的影响","id":"专场结构对竞价的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"主题聚焦与交叉曝光","id":"主题聚焦与交叉曝光"},{"level":3,"text":"竞争密度与专场容量","id":"竞争密度与专场容量"},{"level":2,"text":"排期的变更与冲突","id":"排期的变更与冲突"},{"level":3,"text":"开拍后不可变更的部分","id":"开拍后不可变更的部分"},{"level":3,"text":"slot 冲突与重排","id":"slot-冲突与重排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"托儿、围标与操纵识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-fraud-ops/shill-bid-rig-detect"},"next":{"title":"竞价流动性与价格发现度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-fraud-ops/auction-liquidity-price-discovery"}}